# bootstrap/Brewfile — base Homebrew packages, applied by the 50-brew bootstrap stage.
#
# 50-brew runs `brew bundle --file` on this file, then on every overlay's bootstrap/Brewfile in layer order.
# Apply by hand with: brew bundle --file bootstrap/Brewfile
# Wrap anything that does not exist on Linux in the `if OS.mac?` block at the end.

